        </div>
        <p className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:Bold'] font-bold leading-[44px] left-[24px] text-[30px] text-[color:var(--color-text,#172d28)] top-[271px] w-[784px]" data-node-id="53:532">{`Mesa & Momento`}</p>
        <p className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:SemiBold'] font-semibold leading-[25px] left-[24px] text-[17px] text-[color:var(--color-brand,#145c46)] top-[337px] whitespace-nowrap" data-node-id="53:533">
          Decoración · Zona de atención: Lima
        </p>
        <div className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:Regular'] font-normal leading-[0] left-[24px] text-[17px] text-[color:var(--color-secondary,#566a63)] top-[397px] w-[784px]" data-node-id="53:534">
          <p className="leading-[25px] mb-0">La ficha mostrará fotos, descripción, ubicación o cobertura</p>
          <p className="leading-[25px] mb-0">y el contacto público que proporcionaste.</p>
          <p className="leading-[25px]">Corrige los datos antes de continuar con el pago.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div className="absolute bg-[var(--color-subtle,#e7f3ed)] h-[534px] left-[952px] overflow-clip rounded-[var(--radius-16,16px)] top-[263px] w-[408px]" data-node-id="53:535" data-name="Plan de publicación">
        <p className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:Bold'] font-bold leading-[64px] left-[24px] text-[44px] text-[color:var(--color-brand,#145c46)] top-[24px] whitespace-nowrap" data-node-id="53:536">
          S/ 30
