          Renovación mensual manual
        </p>
        <div className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:Regular'] font-normal leading-[0] left-[24px] text-[17px] text-[color:var(--color-secondary,#566a63)] top-[224px] w-[360px]" data-node-id="53:539">
          <p className="leading-[25px] mb-0">Publicamos cuando el contenido</p>
          <p className="leading-[25px] mb-0">está aprobado y el pago está</p>
          <p className="leading-[25px]">verificado para el periodo.</p>
        </div>
        <Button className="absolute bg-[var(--color-brand,#145c46)] content-stretch cursor-pointer flex gap-[var(--space-8,8px)] h-[48px] items-center justify-center left-[24px] px-[var(--space-20,20px)] py-[var(--space-12,12px)] rounded-[var(--radius-12,12px)] top-[380px] w-[360px]" label="Continuar al pago" />
        <p className="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Manrope:Regular'] font-normal leading-[17px] left-[24px] text-[12px] text-[color:var(--color-secondary,#566a63)] top-[458px] w-[360px]" data-node-id="53:542">
          No hay cargos reales en el prototipo.
